{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/959ef4e406968859fd4fede93c69f921.avif?t=1761651205\" width=750 height=119 /></span>Lady Umbrella is a 3d action-adventure shooter in which the player plays the role of special agent <strong>Francesca De Angelis</strong> (aka Lady Umbrella) who, while infiltrating the last mafia family in Italy, is betrayed and incriminated by her partner and must now clear her name by preventing her own agency from arresting her and defeating the mafia using her main weapon: a shotgun umbrella that when opened functions as a shield and multiple gadgets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close the gap to your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the umbrella-shield and the different traversal mechanics to finish them off with a shotgun blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/70c5d97235223ebd0efd8655eec49bf3.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/70c5d97235223ebd0efd8655eec49bf3.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/70c5d97235223ebd0efd8655eec49bf3.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various multi-purpose gadgets\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Function Umbrella Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between combat, traversal, and puzzle-solving tools \u2014 the umbrella isn\u2019t just a weapon, it\u2019s your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/7d376aa4b464cd214b4342fdd66bd6c0.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/7d376aa4b464cd214b4342fdd66bd6c0.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/7d376aa4b464cd214b4342fdd66bd6c0.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Espionage Meets Mafia Drama</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a web of betrayal and deceit as Lady Umbrella fights to clear her name in her own agency while taking on the ultimate Italian Mafia family. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/248e57ad4555781802e5e0acfd33fcf8.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/248e57ad4555781802e5e0acfd33fcf8.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/248e57ad4555781802e5e0acfd33fcf8.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a frenetic experience in a sprawling Italian Mediterranean city besieged by the mafia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/a7e8d4348b6cfce0a198009c926942fa.avif?t=1761651205\" width=960 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/959ef4e406968859fd4fede93c69f921.avif?t=1761651205\" width=750 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a university project carried out by students at U-tad. The master's degrees involved are design, art, programming, modeling, animation, rigging, and production at U-tad, in addition to the degree in music creation and production at Loyola University.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lady Umbrella","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/b1a631f167c9bfe7f96e75c1aa1b00fc9b7c76fc.jpg"},{"name":"The Shining","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/23f924a3146beb7856f91e74c791ef6d4f2b02b5.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Pick'em All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/18657dda913a3d81540b96611321e5ac965d0359.jpg"},{"name":"Minimax","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/c8bc7f05e394d0978465b1e6f9c8c451664baebf.jpg"},{"name":"Maximin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/a917ab50c3265b2a97f8ef6af6e25733c433db1c.jpg"},{"name":"Smash Goons. Melee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/4388900acc1fdd2970a31afacdbbe384a8ab9bb0.jpg"},{"name":"Kick-starting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/7667b8f851d9c0690dc90a3464d737a1d01209c7.jpg"},{"name":"THIS. IS. ITALIAAAAA!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/2ae83d76022ac174b3871794b93acec2fa1c617a.jpg"},{"name":"Zupa di Pesce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/510836e870b51033444817536b285fb1ad586cfe.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Routine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956890/b0de01c5ca5737aad8e9fffdcdb520eb601bb10f.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956890?t=1761651205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/d357e9b67a0cc8b5fc4ace3535085348d2edc0be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761651205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/cce143296017f3cca2cb29d668d491d6b00c7785/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761651205","capsule_imagev5":