om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/70c5d97235223ebd0efd8655eec49bf3.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/70c5d97235223ebd0efd8655eec49bf3.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various multi-purpose gadgets\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/b73269cf3d376ff34308956ce52895f2.mp4?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Function Umbrella Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between combat, traversal, and puzzle-solving tools \u2014 the umbrella isn\u2019t just a weapon, it\u2019s your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a.poster.avif?t=1761651205\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a.webm?t=1761651205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956890/extras/4865ab04d3867386056260bb73a6441a